Cell["\<\
The real-valued distance is the site-to-adatom search radius. selectedIndices \
is an integer or a list of integers into adatomPositions.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1408767413,ExpressionUUID->"9aa3fd51-3d4a-c644-9821-7b8ff35c8055"],

Cell["\<\
The default labels are {1,0}; the default boundary condition is \"PBC\". \
\"OBC\" selects ordinary Euclidean matching of reference adatom positions.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1811648613,ExpressionUUID->"ca973082-0c47-1648-ad68-2f3d8d708da4"],

Cell["\<\
For \"PBC\", reference adatom equivalence uses fractional coordinates modulo \
lattice translations. Site neighborhoods are then found by a coordinate \
nearest-neighbor search.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->547997012,ExpressionUUID->"7700e7b3-6bcf-fe47-9b13-fe2b2a38ece5"],

Cell["\<\
For unlabeled points the result is a list of label -> coordinates rules. For \
existing rule labels, appends the new label to the existing label information.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1286925747,ExpressionUUID->"c933b3f3-5758-3048-bacc-d35f1d67e343"]
}, Closed]],

